    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，传说（+3）（需牧师或圣武士同调）</em></p><p>这些卡牌背面刻有代表内层位面，外层位面，以及各个神明圣徽的符号。持握该牌组期间，你可以将其作为施法法器，并且你在法术攻击检定及你的法术豁免DC上获得加值。该加值由该牌组的珍稀度决定。</p><p>此外，持握该牌组期间，你可以用动作，抽一张牌，消耗并投掷一枚你的生命骰，加上该牌组的稀有度加值。离你30尺内你可见的一个生物受到等同于该结果的光耀伤害或回复等同于该结果的生命值（由你选择）。</p><p><em>(requires attunement by a cleric or paladin)</em></p><p>The backs of these cards are inscribed with glyphs representing the Inner Planes, the Outer Planes, or the holy symbols of various deities. While holding this deck, you can use it as a spellcasting focus, and you gain a +3 bonus to spell attack rolls and to your spell save DC.</p><p>In addition, while you're holding the deck, you can draw a card as an action to expend and roll one of your Hit Dice and add the deck's bonus to the number rolled. One creature you can see within 30 feet of you either takes radiant damage or regains hit points (your choice) equal to the total.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
